      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِرِّيفٌ</span></b> , from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحُرْفُ</span>, <i>Burning,</i> or <i>biting, to the
tongue:</i> (S, Msb, TA:) it is applied in this sense
to an onion, and to other things: one should not
say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِّيفٌ</span>. (S, TA.)

